<title>USA: MarkWest Q4 proforma shr rises.</title>
<headline>MarkWest Q4 proforma shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr proforma	     $0.61 proforma	 $0.22</p>
